	await novel_interface.show_dialog("Each piece had a color e-ink display on one side showing a fixed image, so it wasn't much different from a traditional puzzle.", "Recording")
	await novel_interface.show_dialog("But when you gradually complete it and fit in the last piece, every tile lights up and the image on the puzzle begins to move...", "Recording")
	await novel_interface.show_dialog("I still remember the first time I played with it. At first I thought we were assembling that famous photograph of Earth called \"The Blue Marble\"--", "Recording")
	await novel_interface.show_dialog("But when my daughter placed the last piece, the whole image began to move: the camera pulled back, passing the Moon, Mars, Jupiter...", "Recording")
	await novel_interface.show_dialog("Then it flew all the way out of the solar system, beyond countless stars, and finally revealed the entire Milky Way.", "Recording")
	await novel_interface.show_dialog("Nasha jumped up in excitement, screaming as she shook my arm, just like I did the first time I completed a heterogeneous matter light-bending experiment...", "Recording")
	await novel_interface.show_dialog("I believe everyone here has experienced a moment like that.", "Recording")
	await novel_interface.show_dialog("That day I ran out of the lab in slippers and pajama pants, shouting all the way into the office of a microbiology professor at our university.", "Recording")
	await novel_interface.show_dialog("The old fellow had once told me that if I could pull off the experiment, he'd open that expensive bottle of Japanese sake his student had given him...", "Recording")
	await novel_interface.show_dialog("That drink nearly choked me to death. I still can't believe it sells for that much.", "Recording")
	await novel_interface.show_text_only("The audience burst into laughter, and some of them applauded.")
	await novel_interface.show_dialog("Later, I gradually came to understand that the process of studying heterogeneous matter really is a lot like doing a puzzle.", "Recording")
	await novel_interface.show_dialog("Before the riddle is finally solved, all you can do is try things based on intuition and a handful of clues.", "Recording")
	await novel_interface.show_dialog("It's like doing a puzzle: first you find the four corners and use them as axioms, as logical fulcrums.", "Recording")
	await novel_interface.show_dialog("Then, starting from the corners, you do everything you can to close the frame.", "Recording")
	await novel_interface.show_dialog("Just as you begin with the most basic axioms and gradually derive logically consistent conclusions.", "Recording")
	await novel_interface.show_dialog("Then, within that completed frame, you keep making trial-and-error attempts, step by step pushing toward the unknown core...", "Recording")
	await novel_interface.show_dialog("The process is long and grueling, and only when the last piece is in place can we catch a glimpse of the truth of the world.", "Recording")
	await novel_interface.show_dialog("During that time, you can let your imagination run wild in anticipation, wondering what kind of magnificent panorama you'll ultimately see.", "Recording")
	await novel_interface.show_dialog("I believe that's the most captivating part of scientific research, and the reason most of us persevere!", "Recording")
	await novel_interface.hide_background()
